{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016Pe4jDqmF2X5V4MUuiG6FR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary of what was built:\n\n**`cmd/du/main.go`** - Recursive directory disk usage reporting (prd009-du R1-R5)\n\n**Flag parsing** (R1, D1): Manual GNU-style parsing matching cmd/wc and cmd/cat patterns. Supports combined short flags (`-sh`), long flags with `=` separator (`--max-depth=3`), `-d N` value consumption, and `--` terminator. Flags: `-a`, `-s`, `-c`, `-h`, `-k`, `-m`, `-b`, `-d N`/`--max-depth=N`, `--si`, `--apparent-size`, `--block-size=N`, `-L`, `-P`, `-0`.\n\n**Directory traversal** (R2, D2): Post-order recursive traversal using `pkg/sys.Lstat` (default) or `pkg/sys.Stat` (`-L`). Disk usage from `fi.Blocks * 512`; apparent size from `fi.Size`.\n\n**Hard-link deduplication** (R3, D3): Tracks `dev+ino` pairs in a `map[inodeKey]bool` across all arguments. Already-counted files contribute 0 to their parent's total.\n\n**Output formatting** (R3): `SIZE\\tPATH\\n` format. Uses `pkg/format.HumanSize` for `-h`/`--si`. Ceiling division for block modes. Grand total with `-c`.\n\n**Error handling** (R4, R5): Errors to stderr with `du:` prefix, continues processing, exits 1 on any error. `sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler()` called at startup. `bufio.Writer` flushed before exit."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":211,"cache_read_input_tokens":137533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":211},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffcf16cc-f1bd-4af0-8cf7-4be580f5f5ef","uuid":"46186deb-f2ea-44ae-bb7d-5aa8be7c0c3b"}
